{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0379cf8d73b827251972279f96471ae4049caeff0dd0ac0fba207bf005b103de",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cc450c8c7837cf5c1df4900c388bbd6bbe7c9b61edd2ee79582e38dce887df9",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー？\n今天谢谢你的祝福～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31f9903ae40c2165d37b65fda4223af051c2959f1f3cc189579e4b72598e9e15",
      "text": "完全没想到克里斯先生和雨彦先生\n会亲自来接我呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea9b462cb610a7022d3faff857c030b2b1de1dede952f0f6110f77a80c2f4dde",
      "text": "吓了一跳吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41b777f19d0c286384981b93181e287049739eac265c6deb32d301b897223ccc",
      "text": "惊喜体验\n如何呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb3a242c7ddc91319c8aba60f1e69060c7d784d2fe22693879d14845476d0a30",
      "text": "吓了一大跳哦～。因为昨天商讨的时候，\n克里斯先生就一副坐立不安的样子，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14e594b281f90d6396933b225714db0643246d2719ac9105af83748731880436",
      "text": "所以我隐约猜到了\n今天可能有什么事情发生呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:535cbbd46542e118d5fadb90edf6c08867c5d00bce90a63127a57b23a421b272",
      "text": "但他们两个人居然直接跑到大学来接我，\n这可真是完全超出了想象呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b1a297f6f4d2eb5efab4365361915f583d924a00df6d8b6e5cf066d452cf0db",
      "text": "等我坐上车一看，\n座椅上还摆着礼物呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e45d3fabf9232d8c0494b560f2a8336e21684bae7b1c04059684ebb382752ba9",
      "text": "真的，从各种意义上来说，\n都是充满了意外惊喜的一天呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_22_t01:1_2_045_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b08008232b0a8385dc95eaf161c81a47f4ce734f58407d2fbd1c7d5cb51b358",
      "text": "那么再次向你说一声，今后也请多关照啦，\n●●●●プロデューサー。辛苦啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
